# Astro / build artefacts
dist/
.astro/
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Auto-generated docs (langdoc emits these on `npm run build`'s
# pre-step). Committing them would put generated content under
# review with no source-of-truth and double the diff size on every
# stdlib change.
src/content/docs/stdlib/*.md
!src/content/docs/stdlib/index.md

# Embedded playground bundle (copied in from web/ at build time;
# committing it would duplicate web/lang.wasm under version control).
public/playground/
